Viewer: a clearly portrait window gets its own portrait stream (2026-10-23).

A 1/3 split is portrait (490x580 on the car tried). It fitted inside the landscape stream, so the page
declared it as an area; the phone kept the stream's landscape layout and squeezed the whole UI into the
portrait area. A clearly portrait window now gets its own portrait stream (one reconnect when turning),
unless the mixed stream is near-square (the car's dock opening and closing still only switches area).
The 2/3 and full landscape stream is unchanged.

